Goals:
  1. Connect with iOS device through bluetooth and send weight sensor data
      There is basic code to do this in "WeightBLESender.ino"
  2. Work with iOS app for "calibration":
      Should measure weight of bottle when full, then when empty -> use for reference in analyzing measurements.
  3. During normal operation, measure & send data when appropriate
      Should use gryoscope data to recognize when bottle is moved (and there is potential for drinking), and
      take/send measurements based on movement and time between measurements.
